##[
Resistor Component Library - Maximum Complexity Stress Test (v0.1.5)
=====================================================================

This file implements resistors across all SMD packages with extreme
complexity to expose compiler weaknesses:

1. Multiple package sizes (01005, 0201, 0402, 0603, 0805, 1206, 1210, 2010, 2512)
2. Parametric definitions with Measurement types
3. Complex metadata with special characters and unicode
4. Extreme SI unit parsing (scientific notation, unicode symbols)
5. Multiple pad shapes (Rectangle, Obround, RoundedRect)
6. Nested property structures
7. Edge case dimensions (microscopic to large)
8. Temperature coefficients with negative values
9. Multiple render configurations
10. Stress test the Symbol Table with many similar names
11. Named coordinate syntax (x:, y:, z:) for absolute positioning
12. Percentage measurements for scale-invariant positioning (v0.1.5)
13. Mixed absolute/relative coordinate expressions
14. Math expressions in measurements

If this compiles cleanly, the component parser is bulletproof.
]##

## ============================================================================
## 01005 Package - Microscopic (0.4mm x 0.2mm) - Tests tiny dimensions
## ============================================================================

component Resistor_01005_1k:
    metadata:
        manufacturer: "Yageo"
        part_number: "RC01005F1001CS"
        package: "01005"
        value: "1kΩ"
        tolerance: "±1%"
        power_rating: "0.031W"
        description: "Ultra-miniature thick film resistor"
        datasheet: "https://example.com/01005.pdf"
        category: "Passive"
        subcategory: "Resistor"
        notes: "Requires specialized pick-and-place equipment"
    
    pins:
        Pin1
        Pin2
    
    layout:
        shape: Rectangle(0.4mm, 0.2mm, 0.13mm)
        pin_positions:
            Pin1 at [0mm, 0.1mm]
            Pin2 at [0.4mm, 0.1mm]
        pad_shapes:
            Pin1: Rectangle(0.2mm, 0.2mm)
            Pin2: Rectangle(0.2mm, 0.2mm)
    
    electrical:
        resistance: 1kΩ
        tolerance: 1%
        max_power: 0.031W
        max_voltage: 15V
        temperature_coefficient: 200ppm
        operating_temp_min: -55°C
        operating_temp_max: 125°C
    
    render:
        type: procedural
        shape: smd_passive
        body_color: "#0a0a0a"
        endcap_color: "#b8b8b8"
        label: "102"

